<title>MEXICO: Mexico lowers jet fuel prices - Pemex.</title>
<headline>Mexico lowers jet fuel prices - Pemex.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico jet fuel prices fell Tuesday to an average 1,757.51 pesos per cubic meter from 1,804.99 pesos, state state-owned oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos.</p>
<p>At the year's start, average fuel prices were at 1,253.50 pesos per cubic meter, the company said.</p>
<p>--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7903</p>
